OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds to strike again at
OL,4,AGreater Manchester hospitals
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 350 staff at four Greater
OL,7,FManchester hospitals are set to strike
OL,8,Fagain in an ongoing row about overtime
OL,9,Fpayments.
OL,11,FUnison said talks had stalled and
OL,12,Fclaimed the Northern Care Alliance NHS
OL,13,FFoundation Trust had rejected offers to
OL,14,Fresume negotiations.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
