OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds to strike again at
OL,4,AGreater Manchester hospitals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe workers, including operating
OL,7,Ftheatre staff at Salford Royal
OL,8,FHospital, Royal Oldham Hospital,
OL,9,FRochdale Infirmary and Fairfield
OL,10,FHospital in Bury, will strike on 14, 15
OL,11,Fand 17 September. The latest action
OL,12,Ffollows previous strikes in June and
OL,13,FAugust.
OL,15,FThe trust said it would do "everything
OL,16,Fit can to minimise the impact on
OL,17,Fpatients and maintain high standards of
OL,18,Fcare and quality at all times."
